      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "射孔效果评估业务问题",
          "html": "<p>试井资料有限，多数井只有生产数据；人工判断低效射孔段缺乏定量依据。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 335\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"压差试验与拟合\"><title>压差试验与拟合</title><rect width=\"720\" height=\"335\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f6f9f8\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#334741\"><path d=\"M124 265H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"end\">-5.45</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><path d=\"M124 211.25H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"216.25\" text-anchor=\"end\">14.31</text><text x=\"259.25\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4.5</text><path d=\"M124 157.5H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"162.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">34.07</text><text x=\"394.5\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><path d=\"M124 103.75H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"108.75\" text-anchor=\"end\">53.83</text><text x=\"529.75\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9.5</text><path d=\"M124 50H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"end\">73.59</text><text x=\"665\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">12</text><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"220.15751493721632\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"151.05\" cy=\"213.30793784060685\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"178.1\" cy=\"201.42363539676964\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"205.15\" cy=\"200.04794426949374\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"232.2\" cy=\"188.73884943471543\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"259.25\" cy=\"180.01442761737962\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"286.3\" cy=\"173.44757703957436\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"313.35\" cy=\"163.3689098812821\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"340.4\" cy=\"158.5589693009194\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"367.45\" cy=\"148.45703369163365\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"394.5\" cy=\"142.7776542487535\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"421.55\" cy=\"132.98954152752847\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"448.6\" cy=\"127.32606750911103\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"475.65\" cy=\"119.63664880319632\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"502.7\" cy=\"116.25424340452815\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"529.75\" cy=\"104.85786679432886\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"556.8\" cy=\"96.00289465513418\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"583.85\" cy=\"92.88879921429015\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"610.9\" cy=\"78.6376143004349\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"637.95\" cy=\"76.06647332314839\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"665\" cy=\"64.82758620689654\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7659a8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" points=\"124,219.31910205635498 665,65.0525433726126\"/><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"219.31910205635498\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7659a8\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"665\" cy=\"65.0525433726126\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7659a8\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><text class=\"plot-x-label\" x=\"394.5\" y=\"324\" text-anchor=\"middle\">压差 / MPa</text><text class=\"plot-y-label\" x=\"24\" y=\"157.5\" transform=\"rotate(-90 24 157.5)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">流量 / m³/d</text></g></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>压差流量直线及留出残差揭示拟合程度；多个物理机制可产生同一斜率，所以拟合好不能直接证明补孔一定有效。图中是初始参数的固定种子教学计算，交互演示可重新计算。</span></div>"
